// Open Headunit (github.com/andreknieriem/open-headunit), tag v.3.5.0-beta4, github flavor
// (`./gradlew assembleGithubRelease`, unsigned) with 0001-Drop-APP_MAPS-APP_NAVIGATION-filter.patch and
// 0002-Drop-navigation-and-map-link-filters.patch (NAVIGATE/geo:/google.navigation:/maps links go to the
// nav app, never a HUR-vs-Maps chooser; HUR's link forwarding to the phone is unused)
// applied: a MAIN + APP_MAPS filter without DEFAULT shows up in every non-MATCH_DEFAULT_ONLY
// query and makes the package manager drop the map card's "Always" choice (handoff D4).
// Built from source and imported as a prebuilt system app so it gets
// FLAG_SYSTEM. Per UsbProfileGroupSettingsManager#getDefaultActivityLocked,
// a system app that's the sole match for a USB_DEVICE_ATTACHED intent
// auto-launches with no resolver dialog and no persisted preference
// needed -- that's what actually fixes the "not listed / doesn't
// remember" USB picker problem, not a runtime override.
android_app_import {
    name: "OpenHeadunit",
    apk: "OpenHeadunit.apk",
    default_dev_cert: true,
    dex_preopt: {
        enabled: false,
    },
}
